---
---
<section id="escuela-museologica-section" class="py-24 md:py-32 px-8 md:px-16 lg:px-24 bg-museum-cream/30 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-16 items-center">
            <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
                <div class="relative group">
                    <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-museum-gold/10 rounded-[2rem] blur-xl group-hover:bg-museum-gold/20 transition-all duration-700"></div>
                    <img 
                        src="/EscuelaMuseologicaLogo.jpeg" 
                        alt="Escuela de Museología" 
                        class="relative rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl w-full h-[500px] object-cover transform group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-700"
                    />
                    <div class="absolute top-8 left-8 bg-museum-dark/90 backdrop-blur px-6 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-museum-gold/20">
                        <p class="text-museum-gold font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase">Formación Técnica</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
                <span class="text-museum-gold font-bold tracking-[0.4em] text-[10px] md:text-xs mb-6 uppercase block">Empoderamiento Patrimonial</span>
                <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-display text-museum-dark mb-8 leading-tight">
                    Escuela de <br/> <span class="text-museum-gold">Museología</span>
                </h2>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-display text-museum-dark/80 mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider">Formación para la Gestión del Patrimonio Barrial</h3>
                <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-museum-gold mb-10"></div>
                
                <p class="text-museum-dark/80 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 font-light">
                    Un espacio de formación técnica y ciudadana diseñado para empoderar a los líderes locales y jóvenes en la protección, curaduría y difusión de la memoria histórica y cultural de sus territorios.
                </p>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-museum-gold font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Líneas de Trabajo</h4>
                        <ul class="space-y-2 text-museum-dark/70 text-sm font-medium">
                            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-museum-gold"></span>
                                Curaduría Comunitaria
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-museum-gold"></span>
                                Conservación Preventiva
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-museum-gold"></span>
                                Mediación Cultural
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-museum-gold/10">
                        <h4 class="text-museum-gold font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Visión</h4>
                        <p class="text-museum-dark/70 text-xs italic leading-relaxed">
                            "Convertir a los habitantes en los propios guardianes y narradores de su patrimonio vivo."
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <a href="/escuela-museologica" class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-6 text-museum-dark font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-xs uppercase hover:text-museum-gold transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full border border-museum-dark/20 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:border-museum-gold transition-colors">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
                    </div>
                    Conocer la Escuela
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
